    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone else!? Any wounded?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No worries here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "None here, either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Communications equipment?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unharmed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this its burrow? ...Strange.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They seemed like sand beasts, at least?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sand beasts, of this size? Over two meters long?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I've spent the better part of my life in these wastelands, but never have I seen a sand beast capable of digging holes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "...These creatures have Originium crystals on their bodies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Possibly biological mutations caused by Originium pollution, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no nomadic cities, no factories and no mines. How does Originium pollution even happen here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Could it have been a Catastrophe's fault?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd be underestimating nature. Wildlife knows Catastrophes far better than we do. These creatures would've been the first to avoid Originium pollution.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cities can be torn apart by Catastrophes while the wildlife emerges untouched",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Nature in this world is ruthless when it wants to eliminate you. If you don't have some way of dealing with Originium, your time as a living species won't be long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think... I have a hypothesis. Like ordinary Originium Slugs, the body's outer shell could have absorbed Originium into its makeup, while its innards remain clean and uncorrupted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "On that note, has P.R.T.S ever recorded any similar cases?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "None. Not even for the Ironforge City leakage incident in Columbia, and that's the first thing you'd think of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sand beasts are docile creatures by nature. Originium shouldn't change them so drastically, and I can't imagine anything short of Arts would make them outright aggressive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay vigilant. Don't let your guard down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Arts? A Caster? I just hope this doesn't complicate things for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let it worry you too much. We'll continue on as we were, anyhow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
