    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "An burst of sharp static, and communications break off.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, that's not good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$suspenseful_intro",
        "key": "$suspenseful_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "What does Watchtower 33 refer to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the sound of it, it seemed like a Rhodes Island safehouse's code name.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A safehouse? The mission brief didn't mention any safehouses around here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Truthfully, in a few areas, Rhodes Island will make a habit of hiding some safehouses, out of the way. For use in very particular field missions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we ourselves don't know where Watchtower 33 is.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "Long Spring... Long Spring...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "That name rings a faint bell. If you could let me see the map for a second.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, if I'm not mistaken. Following about twenty kilometers north from Trumhill, you should find another canyon. That canyon had a little village near it, I'm sure of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "That village, years ago, had a well. One of the very few reliable water sources for miles around.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's why it's Long Spring?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So. What do we do next? Change of plans?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_155_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_156_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Or we can try and make for Phecon overnight, get in touch with the branch office and see what assistance we can procure from them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I worry the operator in the safehouse may not last long enough for that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of you, keep going until you reach Phecon, and find some support or other there if you can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll head for Long Spring and see what the situation is. Don't you worry, I know this land very, very well. Indeed, I can afford to be more flexible on my lonesome.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "If things get out of hand there, I'll head back for Phecon promptly and join up with you all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I object.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166",
        "name2": "char_503_rang",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_166"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm aware how wary it is of me to say our sand-burrowing mutants and the safehouse's distress call might not just be coincidence, but the Sargon barrens demand we must maintain vigilance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "text": "We are not clear about the area surrounding Long Spring. Given we are not, you would gamble more alone than you can afford, Rangers, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Schwarz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_156_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd also like to recommend we move for Long Spring as one. If things aren't friendly for us, we can still cover for each other, especially during a retreat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_503_rang"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "That does make sense.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, you're right. The old man will listen. I ought to at my age, anyhow. Can't be as spry and reckless as I was in my younger years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rangers"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
