    },
    {
        "text": "(Russian) Originium...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Russian) It boggles my mind that this world has such an extraordinary existence gracing it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Russian) Yet somehow, these locals fear it in their ignorance. Fear what evolution this great power brings with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Russian) But no, oh, of course, they should be afraid.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Russian) For the fool fears the unknown. The fool fears might. The fool fears progress...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_157_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Russian) Ignorants, oh, you ignorants.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Levi"
    },
